{"step_index":278,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T23:55:36Z","thinking":"Examining the user's requests: The first involves retrieving industry information from a specific source, prioritizing business registration numbers, then company names, and finally, a fallback method if neither is available. The second requires linking the complete source URL after finding the corporate number. Finally, the third specifies including the source for the fiscal year information.\n\n\nA file backup is necessary before data modification. The target rows are identified, columns for update are confirmed. Industry classification uses a designated source, and the user's criteria are incorporated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\n\nasync function processFull500() {\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  const backupSrc = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_11847_12000.xlsx';\n  const fullBackup = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명_backup_11847_12346.xlsx';\n  \n  // 1. Ensure master backup exists\n  if (!fs.existsSync(fullBackup)) {\n    fs.copyFileSync(backupSrc, fullBackup);\n    console.log('Created master backup at:', fullBackup);\n  }\n  \n  // Restore original starting state\n  fs.copyFileSync(fullBackup, filePath);\n  \n  // 2. Read verified 500 rows\n  const tsvLines = fs.readFileSync('all_500_verified.tsv', 'utf-8').split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n  console.log('Total verified rows:', tsvLines.length);\n  \n  // 3. Load workbook\n  console.log('Loading workbook...');\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  \n  